{
  "version": 1,
  "mappingRevision": 1,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Plip—one silver ripple starts small.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Reef, shore, deep blue—the alphabet widens with it.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "A - Angelfish! Tall fins fan; flat body turns | slipping between coral branches as reef light flickers.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "B ... B ... Buoy! Tethered, it bobs without drifting away | a floating marker may show a channel, hazard, or mooring.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "C is for Coral. Tiny animals live together in colonies | their hard skeletons build reef structure layer by layer.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "D? Dock! A platform by the shore | boats tie up or load beside it.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Here comes E with Eel. Long fish, no legs | the whole body waves side to side through dark reef gaps.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "F - Fish! Fins steer; gills take oxygen from water | one tail beat sends the swimmer farther.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "G ... G ... Grouper! Stout reef fish, broad mouth | waiting near ledges, holes, and shade.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "H is for Harbor. Wind and waves ease behind shelter | boats find calmer water to anchor or dock.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Splash, glide, rise—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Ocean Letter Splash—from shore to sea!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "I? Island! Land with water all around | one still shape wrapped in moving blue.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "J - Jetty! Built from shore into moving water | it can protect a coast or help guide a channel.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Kayak - that's K. Narrow boat, double-bladed paddle | left stroke, right stroke, it moves and turns.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "L ... L ... Lobster! Jointed legs walk the seafloor | long antennae feel the way ahead.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "M is for Mussel. Two shell halves close tight | silky threads grip rock when the tide pulls by.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "N? Narwhal! Arctic whale in cold blue | its famous spiral tusk is really a long tooth.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "O - Octopus! Eight arms feel and grip | a soft body can squeeze through tight openings.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Here comes P with Pelican. Wings over the surface, bill dipping low | the throat pouch catches fish and drains water.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-4-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-4",
      "text": "Splash, glide, rise—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-4-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-4",
      "text": "Ocean Letter Splash—from shore to sea!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Q ... Q ... Quahog! Say KOH-hog | a hard clam burrowed in coastal sand or mud.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "R is for Ray. Wide pectoral fins ripple like wings | the body glides just above the sand.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "S? Seahorse! Upright fish, tiny fin flutter | a curled tail grips seagrass when the current tugs.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "T - Turtle! Shell on its back; ocean turtles use broad flippers | steady strokes carry them through open water.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-U",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "U is Undersea Cave. Rock opens below the waves | a dark hollow where seawater reaches in.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-V",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "V ... V ... Violet Sea Snail! Purple-blue and tiny | it hangs beneath a bubble raft at the ocean surface.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-W",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "W is for Whale. A marine mammal with air in its lungs | it rises to breathe at the surface, then rolls below.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-X",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "X? X-ray Tetra! Our X visitor is freshwater, not sea | translucent sides let a pale backbone show.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-6-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-6",
      "text": "Splash, glide, rise—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-6-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-6",
      "text": "Ocean Letter Splash—from shore to sea!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Y - Yellowfin Tuna! Yellow fins and finlets flash | a streamlined body powers through open ocean.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Z ... Z ... Zooplankton! Many are tiny drifters carried by currents | our last letter rides the moving water that opened the song.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "interlude-1",
      "sectionId": "mid-interlude",
      "text": "The ripple turns. I give the letter; you bring the sea-and-shore word back.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-A",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "A ... Angelfish! Fan both hands, then glide.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-B",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "B - what bobs? ... Buoy! Let one hand rise and fall.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-C",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "C - reef builder? ... Coral! Spread fingers into branches.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-D",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Find D at the shore ... Dock! One flat forearm makes a platform.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-E",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Who bends with E? ... Eel! Wave one hand side to side.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-F",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "F - fins and gills ... Fish! Swish one hand like a tail.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-G",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "G hides in reef shade ... Grouper! Make one slow fish glide.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-H",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "H - calmer water ... Harbor! Curve both hands into a sheltered bay.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-2-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-2",
      "text": "Splash, glide, rise—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-2-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-2",
      "text": "Ocean Letter Splash—from shore to sea!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-I",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Water all around - what is I? ... Island! Circle one still fist.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-J",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "J reaches from shore ... Jetty! Slide one flat hand outward.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-K",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Double paddle starts K ... Kayak! Air-paddle left, then right.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-L",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Seafloor walker - L ... Lobster! Walk two fingers across your palm.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-M",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Two shell halves - M ... Mussel! Close two palms gently.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-N",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Spiral tooth - N ... Narwhal! Trace one spiral, then glide.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-O",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Eight arms - who is O? ... Octopus! Wiggle both hands softly.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-P",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Bill and pouch - P ... Pelican! Scoop one hand, then lift.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Splash, glide, rise—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Ocean Letter Splash—from shore to sea!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Q",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Q ... Quahog! KOH-hog—close two palms like a clam.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-R",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Wide fins over sand - R ... Ray! Glide both hands flat and wide.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-S",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Upright, curled tail - S ... Seahorse! Curl one finger to grip.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-T",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Shell, broad flippers - T ... Turtle! Make a shell, then swim once.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-U",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Dark hollow under waves - U ... Undersea Cave! Arch both hands.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-V",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Bubble raft - V ... Violet Sea Snail! Trace a spiral, then float.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-W",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Who rises to breathe? W ... Whale! Lift once, then glide down.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-X",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Freshwater visitor - X ... X-ray Tetra! Small fish glide—remember: freshwater.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Y",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Yellow fins - Y ... Yellowfin Tuna! Sweep one hand fast and smooth.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Z",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Tiny drifters - Z ... Zooplankton! Let fingertips ride the current.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Splash, glide, rise—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Ocean Letter Splash—from shore to sea!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-1",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "One last silver ripple touches the shore.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-2",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "A to Z grows quiet; the water moves once more.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    }
  ]
}
